加，共</span></span><span><span>10</span></span><span><span>人，设特等奖</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>人，一等奖</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>人，二等奖</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>人，三等奖</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>人。</span></span></p></td><td><br/></td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\"><p><span>7</span><span>月</span><span><span>13</span></span><span><span><span>日</span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>周日）</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span>上午</span><span>9</span><span>：</span><span>00 - 11</span><span>：</span><span>30</span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>营员</span></span><span>分</span></span></span><span>4</span><span><span><span>组</span><span><span>参加优秀营员考核</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><br/></td></tr><tr><td><p><span>下午</span><span><span>1</span></span><span>：</span><span><span><span>3</span></span><span>0 - 5</span></span><span>：</span><span>00</span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>播放学院宣传视频；</span></span><span>闭营仪式</span></span></span></p></td><td><br/></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><a href=\"https://marx.shnu.edu.cn/ad/e4/c2465a830948/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><strong>（五）优秀营员评选</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>学院本次暑期夏令营将根据学生综合考核表现评选一定比例的优秀营员，</span></span><span><span><span>并颁发优秀营员证书</span></span></span><span><span>。综合考核包括专业基础和综合能力。届时学院将成立考核专家小组，通过</span></span><span><span><span>现场</span></span></span><span><span>面试的方式对营员进行考核。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><strong>三、联系方式</strong></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>联系人：高海燕、</span></span><span><span><span>吴亚樵</span></span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span><span>陈妍雨</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span>活动咨询电话：</span></span><span><span>021-64328930</span></span><span><span><span><span>（高海燕）、</span></span><span><span><span>吴亚樵</span></span></span><span><